# Story 8: Navigate Mode (40s)
# Hook: Navigate your pane grid -- Tab cycles through them all.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-08-navigate-mode.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 6

[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
Navigate your pane grid -- Tab cycles through them all.

[00:03.0 --> 00:06.0]
Start rysh with a single pane.

[00:06.0 --> 00:16.0]
Let's build a 2x2 grid. Ctrl+P n splits right, Ctrl+P v splits down.

[00:16.0 --> 00:26.0]
Label each quadrant so we can see focus change.

[00:26.0 --> 00:36.0]
Tab cycles focus through every pane. Watch the highlighted border move around the grid.

[00:36.0 --> 00:40.0]
Four panes, one key to navigate. Tab takes you through each pane in order.

